<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/election-candidate/2026-general--rafael-varela">Rafael Varela</a> (Write-in): Declared write-in candidate; the name is not printed on the ballot. No platform or campaign website found.</li>
<li><a href="/directdemocracy/app/election-candidate/2026-general--richard-benedict-mayers">Richard Benedict Mayers</a> (Independent, Write-in): Declared write-in candidate; the name is not printed on the ballot. No platform or campaign website found. He was disqualified from the governor ballot after objections to his nominating petitions.</li>
